---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="values - based.health">
    <div class="mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Values & Principles</h2>
        <p class="py-2">
            based.health is built on a few simple rules. Since this is a
            community project, these values help us decide what protocols and
            products belong here and what should be rejected.
        </p>
    </div>

    <main class="py-8 space-y-10">
        <section>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#a64d79] uppercase text-sm mb-2">
                1. No Nasty Chemicals
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                We avoid "endocrine disruptors." These are just chemicals that
                mess with your body's natural hormones. They can lower
                testosterone and make you feel tired or foggy.
                <br /><br />
                <strong>The Rule:</strong> No cheap plastics (BPA/BPS), no "forever
                chemicals" (PFAS), and no fake smells (Fragrance/Parfum). We prefer
                glass, steel, and natural ingredients.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#a64d79] uppercase text-sm mb-2">
                2. The Community is the Boss
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                There is no company behind this. It is a public directory. If
                you see a product that is actually unhealthy or a protocol that
                is wrong, you are encouraged to fix it via GitHub.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#a64d79] uppercase text-sm mb-2">
                3. Zero Marketing Noise
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                We don't do ads or "sponsored" content. Even if a famous
                influencer suggests a product, we check the ingredients first.
                If it doesn't meet the clean standard, it doesn't get listed.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-[#a64d79] uppercase text-sm mb-2">
                4. Stupid Simple
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Health should be easy to understand. We keep the language plain
                and the steps clear so anyone can start improving their life
                immediately.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
